sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor Merchant
  participant POS as Merchant POS
  participant QR as Signed QR
  actor Customer
  participant Guardian as Guardian Engine
  participant KimiProxy as /api/ai/explain
  participant Wallet as EVM Wallet
  participant Registry as Monad Registry
  participant AUSD as Agora AUSD
  participant Envio as Envio HyperIndex

  Note over Merchant,QR: Bill creation (off-chain)
  Merchant->>POS: Enter items, quantities, prices
  POS->>POS: Compute subtotal + tax (integer paise)
  POS->>POS: EIP-712 sign with merchant private key
  POS->>QR: Emit signed JSON QR payload

  Note over Customer,Guardian: Verification (on-device, before any wallet action)
  Customer->>Guardian: Scan QR or load scenario
  Guardian->>Guardian: Check 1 - Verify EIP-712 signature vs TRUSTED_MERCHANTS
  Guardian->>Guardian: Check 2 - Compare requested paise vs signed total
  Guardian->>Guardian: Check 3 - Validate expiry timestamp
  Guardian->>Guardian: Check 4 - Check billIdHash vs local duplicate cache
  Guardian->>Guardian: Check 5 - Evaluate user spending rules
  Guardian->>Guardian: Audit line-item arithmetic (advisory)
  Guardian-->>Customer: Verdict: safe / review / blocked

  Note over KimiProxy: AI explanation (server-side, never blocks Guardian)
  Guardian->>KimiProxy: POST structured verification result
  KimiProxy->>KimiProxy: Call Moonshot API (moonshot-v1-8k)
  alt Kimi available
    KimiProxy-->>Customer: Live AI explanation (source: kimi)
  else Kimi unavailable
    KimiProxy-->>Customer: Deterministic fallback (source: deterministic-fallback)
  end

  Note over Customer,Registry: Payment authorization (explicit user action required)
  alt Verdict is safe
    Customer->>Wallet: Hold-to-pay gesture triggers wallet call
    Wallet->>Customer: Request explicit transaction approval
    Customer->>Wallet: Approve
    Wallet->>Registry: settleWithToken(billId, reportHash, AUSD, amount, merchant)
    Registry->>AUSD: transferFrom(payer, merchant, tokenAmount)
    AUSD-->>Registry: Transfer success
    Registry->>Registry: Mark billIdHash as recorded (replay prevention)
    Registry-->>Wallet: Emit ReceiptRecorded + PaymentSettled events
    Wallet-->>Customer: Transaction hash returned
    Note over Wallet: App polls RPC for confirmation
    Registry-->>Customer: Status: submitted > confirmed (or rejected/failed)
  else No wallet connected
    Note over Customer: Simulated demo receipt (isSimulated=true)
    Note over Customer: No tx broadcast, no tokens moved
  end

  Note over Envio: Indexing (requires deployed Envio instance)
  Registry-->>Envio: ReceiptRecorded event (when indexer running)
  Envio-->>Customer: Indexed history in /activity (when available)
